+  "bare_product_mention": "a bare product mention with no verb ('X؟') is task_type=ambiguous with candidate_intents [GET_PRODUCT_SALES, GET_PRODUCT_STOCK, SEARCH_PRODUCT]; NOT single",
+  "weekday_ranges": "weekday-only ranges keep the textual range in date_range but trigger needs_clarification for the missing week anchor",
+  "depends_on": "0-based index of the prerequisite intent inside the same intents array (multi only); always null for single",
+  "dates": "relative expressions limited to the 8 standard tokens (today..last_year); Shamsi dates stay Shamsi, entity values use Latin digits while the raw text keeps its own digits; bare year like '1402' is a valid date_range value",
