+  "product_name": "entity value always holds the canonical product name in standard orthography, even when the raw text contains typos (نوشابا -> نوشابه) or colloquial pronunciations (نون بربری -> نان بربری); transliterations of Latin names stay as written in text (تایپ سی) unless a canonical Persian form exists",
