+  "typos": "realistic typos are kept in text (فوش/گزاراش/نوشابا) while entities/intent stay correct - the model must be robust to them; غ->گ substitution in proper names (اصگری->اصغری S-0268) extends typo canonicalisation to customer_name - first customer-name entry in the canonical_value_exceptions registry (typo_to_standard family)",
