+  "category_qualifiers": "category words (نوشیدنی‌ها، لبنیات) are not representable in v0.2 entity set; kept out of entities and flagged for human review; plural category word + display verb («شیرینی‌ها رو نشون بده») is a DETERMINATE catalog browse (SP, empty entities, S-0269): GLS needs a stock framing (A-0018 contrast) and GPSK needs a single product; the unrepresentable category query is the documented v0.3 gap",
+  "chained_calls": "a dependent intent slot may carry empty-or-partial entities when the missing parameters come from the prerequisite call result via depends_on (multi only); linear family: M-0002 GLS->GPSK, M-0004 SP->GPSK, M-0011 SC->GCI, M-0015 SI->GCI, M-0026 SP->GPS (partial), M-0038 GTP->GPSK, M-0049 SI->GCI (question-form owner ask «بگو مال کدوم مشتریه», 2nd SI-headed member), M-0050 GLI->GPSK (FIRST GLI-headed chain, «کالاهاش» anaphora over invoice items); FAN-OUT family: two dependents on one head - M-0044 GLS->GPSK+GPS, M-0045 SP->GPSK+GPS, M-0048 SC->GCI, M-0052 GLS->GPSK+GPS (5-slot ceiling, plus independent GTP+GDS); chaining is justified only by anaphoric or superlative reference - explicit entities stay independent (M-0024 contrast); 6 distinct head intents now (GLS/SP/SC/GTP/SI/GLI)",
+  "batch_size_policy": "since batch 9: batches grow to 18-45 samples with compact chat display (table instead of full JSON) to reduce number of ادامه rounds; full JSON always in files",
+  "search_product": "SEARCH_PRODUCT carries the search query in product_name (v0.2 has no query entity); explicit catalog-search verbs (جستجو، بگرد، پیدا کن، دنبال ...) distinguish it from GET_PRODUCT_STOCK existence questions ('X داریم؟' stays stock per S-0073); brand-only queries kept verbatim in product_name, flagged for v0.3",
+  "gli": "GET_LAST_INVOICE: bare 'آخرین فاکتور' without a customer = store-level request with empty entities; customer reference may be customer_name (honorific آقای/خانم stripped, bare name kept), phone (Latin digits) or customer_id (Latin-digit string); GLI takes NO date - time words like 'دیشب' are discourse noise; synonyms صورتحساب/فاکتور both map to the invoice family",
+  "sp_catalog_anchor": "catalog-existence framings (تو فهرست/کاتالوگ کالاها، ثبت شده؟) are SEARCH_PRODUCT; warehouse-existence framings (انبار، موجودی) are GET_PRODUCT_STOCK; the anchor word decides, not the verb داریم (minimal pair S-0121 vs S-0073)",
+  "si_vs_gli": "singular positional 'آخرین/آخر فاکتور X' -> GET_LAST_INVOICE; plural 'فاکتورهای X' or filter-based lookup (by number/date/customer) -> SEARCH_INVOICE; invoice_number holds Latin-digit string; SI accepts invoice_number, customer_name, customer_id, phone and date/date_range filters; «فاکتور جدید» is temporal, not positional: ambiguous [GLI, SI] (A-0016: newest-one reading vs recent-list reading) while «آخرین/آخر فاکتور» stays determinate GLI",
+  "gci_vs_sc": "GET_CUSTOMER_INFO = unique customer reference (name incl. stripped honorifics, id, phone) asking for the profile; field framings (شماره تماس/آدرس/کد ملی ...) are response-format, not entities; SEARCH_CUSTOMER = plural/filtered/list framing over the customer base (city, category filters kept out of entities per category_qualifiers convention); INDEFINITE existence framings (مشتری‌ای به اسم X داریم؟ / با شماره X ثبت شده؟) are SC; minimal pair S-0168 (اطلاعات مشتری خانم مرادی -> GCI) vs S-0174 (مشتریای تهران رو لیست کن -> SC); bare 'مشتری X؟' is ambiguous between the two (A-0006); ایمیل joins the response-format field framings; کد مشتری N -> customer_id; پروفایل/فایل are profile-retrieval synonyms (S-0254/S-0255/S-0258/S-0260)",
+  "gtp": "GET_TOP_PRODUCTS = ranking of products by sales; date (single day) or date_range (multi-day/year 1402) optional; limit holds plain int (تاپ ۵، ده تای اول، ۱۰ کالای پرفروش); habitual present-tense framing without period takes empty entities and NC=false (S-0199 - timeless preference ranking) while a CONCRETE superlative ask without period is single+NC missing_date_or_range (S-0272 «پرفروش‌ترین‌ها؟»); synonyms پرفروش‌ترین/برترین/بهترین فروشنده‌ها/تاپ; 'بیشترین فروش' bare is ambiguous GTP vs GSR (A-0007); کم‌فروش‌ترین stays GTP (same sales axis, S-0271) while stock-axis ranking is unsupported (O-0033)",
+  "delivery_channel": "delivery/format wishes (ایمیل کن S-0206, اکسل کن S-0270, واتساپ کن, پرینت بگیر) are response-format noise, never entities and never a second intent; the data request keeps its intent; RATIFIED in batch 21 with two members (GSR+ایمیل, GLS+اکسل); contrast O-0028: print noise does NOT rescue unsupported CONTENT (price query) - noise-on-supported-intent stays in-scope, unsupported content stays OOS regardless of channel wish",
+  "bare_mention_family": "bare mention + ؟ with no verb is ambiguous between the plausible actions on that object: product (A-0001: sales/stock/search), موجودی (A-0002: stock/low-stock list), invoice number (A-0005: open invoice/owner info), customer name (A-0006: profile lookup vs customer search); candidates must be actions genuinely plausible WITHOUT the missing verb",
+  "oos_category": "out_of_scope samples carry oos_category from the 12-token English whitelist (weather, news, entertainment, general_knowledge, tutoring, creative_writing, finance_crypto, general_advice, car_repair, design, unsupported_business_feature, chitchat); intents=[], candidate_intents=[], needs_clarification=false; Stage A validator enforces since batch 10; financial computations beyond sales are unsupported_business_feature even with sales-adjacent vocabulary: سود profit (O-0015) and مالیات tax (O-0018) are NOT GET_SALES_REPORT - revenue words فروش/درآمد map to GSR (S-0032) but سود needs cost basis; customer-balance بدهی (O-016) is NOT GET_CUSTOMER_INFO - profile only; deliberate confusion-risk pairs with in-scope framings; price display queries («قیمت X چنده؟») are unsupported_business_feature (O-0021): v0.2 SP returns catalog presence, not price - price joins the سود/مالیات/بدهی beyond-defined-outputs family, flagged for v0.3 intent design; executing a discount «ده درصد تخفیف بده» is a write-op unsupported (O-0026) while ASKING ADVICE about discount timing is general_advice (O-0012) - advice/action contrast documented; response-format noise does NOT rescue an out-of-scope request: «لیست قیمت کالاها رو پرینت بگیر» is unsupported_business_feature because the CONTENT (price) is undefined in v0.2 even though پرینت is delivery noise (O-0028); store-settings write-ops (ساعت کاری تغییر بده O-0027) are unsupported; assistant-personal questions (چند سالته O-0029) are chitchat; business decisions asked as advice (استخدام O-0030) are general_advice; stock-ranking questions («بیشترین موجودی مال کدوم کاله؟» O-0033) are unsupported_business_feature: v0.2 has no ranking-by-stock intent (GLS is the ascending reorder list only, GPSK needs a product reference, SP filters by name) - parked edge case resolved with this decision, flagged for v0.3 intent design; bulk pricing actions («تخفیف بذار» O-0034) and outbound communication «ایمیل به تامین‌کننده» O-0035) are unsupported write-ops",
+  "minimal_pairs": "near-identical texts with different labels are kept deliberately when they differ in exactly one discriminating token (S-0031 vs A-0003); batch-21 additions: S-0271 «کم‌فروش‌ترین» vs S-0205 «پرفرروش‌ترین» at 0.795 (inverted-ranking boundary, same GTP family), A-0024 vs A-0019 at 0.675 (comparison axis flip period<->product), M-0051 vs M-0020 at 0.722 (GLI+SI distinct referents vs shared referent), S-0270 vs S-0090 at 0.667 (اکسل export noise + colloquial vs formal display, same «اتمام» anchor family)",
+  "gds": "GET_DAILY_SUMMARY = day-recap; خلاصه-anchor determinacy: خلاصه امروز/این ماه without فروش is determinate GDS, خلاصه فروش ... is ambiguous GDS/GSR (A-0003); گزارش کار/گزارش روزانه/یادداشت روزانه/جمع‌بندی are GDS synonyms while گزارش فروش stays GSR; date (single day) or date_range (week/month of per-day summaries); missing date -> single+NC (S-0239); bare «گزارش» without فروش/کار/روزانه qualifier is ambiguous [GSR, GDS] (A-0011); گزارش کار/روزانه -> GDS, گزارش فروش -> GSR, bare گزارش + day -> clarify",
+  "gsc": "GET_SALES_COMPARISON needs two evidenced periods; period_a = first-mentioned period in text; single-period requests never trigger GSC; percentage framings (چند درصد) and which-better questions (بهتر بود یا) are GSC; both periods missing -> single+NC missing_comparison_periods (S-0251); one period + vague قبل -> NC (S-0224)",
+  "customer_id_vs_name": "bare customer NAME + ؟ is ambiguous [GET_CUSTOMER_INFO, SEARCH_CUSTOMER] (A-0006: names are searchable over the base); bare unique customer_id + ؟ is DETERMINATE GCI (S-0262: id is a direct lookup, no search interpretation) - id/name asymmetry documented",
+  "multi_expansion": "multi patterns ratified in batch 17: repeated intent on the DATE axis (M-0001/M-0008/M-0009/M-0016 incl. 3-slot day/week/month + جدا marker) and on the PRODUCT axis (M-0013) and CUSTOMER axis (M-0017 GCI x2, M-0018 GLI x2); shared parameters carried in every slot that needs them (M-0003/M-0006/M-0007/M-0013/M-0014/M-0020); reversed slot order is distinct data (M-0014 stock->sales vs M-0003 sales->stock); intra-family discrimination inside one utterance (M-0020 GLI singular vs SI plural+filter); greeting noise tolerated in multi (M-0021, like singles S-0004/S-0016); GSC-in-multi requires both periods in text (M-0010); batch-18 ratifications: terse noun-phrase enumeration extends to 4 slots (M-0029 روتین framing, no verbs); 3-slot mixed with GSC requires گزارش فروش explicit in the GSR slot (M-0025, A-0011 lesson applied); SI x2 with different filter slots (M-0027); explicit product in a second slot makes it INDEPENDENT even after a GLS list (M-0024 resolves the parked borderline: chaining only when the parameter is anaphoric «هر کدومشون/این هفته‌ش»); SC-in-multi carries city filter out of entities (M-0031, S-0174 family); typos tolerated in multi (M-0030 گزاراش/پرفروش‌تریناش); batch-19 ratifications: shared-month Shamsi dates repeat the month name in text so each entity is fully evidenced (M-0032 «۱۰ آبان و ۱۱ آبان», unlike S-0007 range elision); mixed reference types inside one repeated multi (M-0033 customer_id + customer_name); SI x3 with three different filter slots (M-0035); GPSK x2 product-axis (M-0036); GSR+GSC shared period (M-0034); GSC x2 two period pairs (M-0040); terse noun-phrase multi with question mark (M-0039); superlative-as-reference chain (M-0038); batch-20 ratifications: FAN-OUT chains allow two dependents on one head (M-0044/M-0045/M-0048); 3-slot single-entity-family multi GCI+GLI+SI with shared explicit name (M-0043, M-0020 pattern with GCI head); GDS+GSR+GSC combo with مقایسه‌ش anaphora to the nearer report (M-0046); mixed date granularity per slot in repeated intent (M-0041 Shamsi + relative, کل as emphasis noise); batch-21 ratifications (FINAL expansion batch): GLI+SI with DISTINCT referents (M-0051 my-last-invoice vs پاکزاد's invoices, vs M-0020 shared customer; contrast A-0016 single-mention ambiguity); 5-slot closing-routine ceiling with fan-out inside (M-0052 GLS->GPSK+GPS + GTP + GDS, situational framing «قبل از بستن مغازه»); first multi+NC (M-0053); question-form owner-ask chain (M-0049)",
+  "terse_register": "single-word/ultra-terse requests resolve by anchor analysis: bare «فروش؟» -> GSR+NC (S-0263: فروش anchors sales-report; no خلاصه/مرور anchor -> not GDS, no ranking framing -> not GTP); bare «گزارش؟» -> ambiguous [GSR, GDS] (A-0014: گزارش is generic without qualifier); bare «موجودی؟» -> ambiguous [GPSK, GLS] (A-0002 precedent); bare «پرفروش‌ترین‌ها؟» -> GTP+NC (S-0272, batch 22: superlative sales-ranking anchor is intent-determinate, only the period is missing - completes NC single coverage 12/12; contrast A-0002 which is intent-ambiguous and S-0199 habitual-present which is timeless/NC=false)",
+  "verb_narrowed_mention": "a bare product mention narrowed by a display verb («X رو ببین») is ambiguous between the display actions only: [GET_PRODUCT_STOCK, SEARCH_PRODUCT] (A-0015) - the sales reading (GPS) needs فروش/فروخت framing, so it is NOT a candidate; bare mention with no verb stays 3-way [GPS, GPSK, SP] (A-0001); customer side: bare customer name + display verb («X رو ببین») is ambiguous [GET_CUSTOMER_INFO, SEARCH_CUSTOMER] (A-0017) - verb narrowing yields the 2 display actions per entity type: products [GPSK, SP] (A-0015), customers [GCI, SC] (A-0017)",
